!text: \[ \int {{c2::\frac{-1}{ |u|\sqrt{a^2 + u^2} }::\ldots}} \, du = {{c1::\frac{1}{a} \operatorname{csch}^{-1} \frac{u}{a}::\ldots}} + C, \quad a > 0,\ u \ne 0 \]
!related:
